     "texto": [
      "**The discovery**: During the museum's reopening works, the workers find a forgotten box behind a wardrobe, with holdings from the old theatre closed in 1952.",
      "**The anomaly**: The restorer spots a portrait of an actor not recorded in the official minutes.",
      "**The investigation**: A historian checks the press archives of the period and uncovers a labour dispute that led to the performer's resignation.",
      "**The ethical decision**: Before displaying the pieces to the public, the management decides to ask its descendants for express consent."
